# README-only repo (TNSM-style): the source is NOT tracked here. This repo
# exists only to host Releases (the built .exe is uploaded as a release asset
# by scripts/bump-version.ps1). GitHub's auto "Source code" zip will contain
# only the README, so your source is never exposed.
#
# WARNING: because the source is gitignored, GitHub is NOT a backup of your
# code. Keep your own backup of A:\tnsm-relay-ws.

# Ignore everything by default...
/*

# ...then un-ignore ONLY what we want public.
!.gitignore
!README.md
